            "text": "[explore_and_descend: descended 1 floor(s) over 82 game steps.]\n\n=== JOURNAL ===\nObjective: Descend as deep into the dungeon as you can and survive; ultimately win the game (retrieve the Amulet of Yendor and escape).\n\nYour notes:\n  - dlvl_1_summary: [offline-summary] (query='key events on dlvl 1') (no notes recorded on this level)…\n\n=== MAP ===\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                   -----.----.-----\n                   |..............|\n                   |..............|\n                   |..@d........%.|\n                   ...............|\n                   ----------------\n\n\n\n\n=== STATUS ===\nHP: 16/16  AC: 6  Dlvl: 2  Turn: 269  XP: 1  $: 7  Pos: (22,17)\nCharacter: valkyrie (human, neutral)\n\n=== INVENTORY ===\n  $: 7 gold pieces\n  b: a +1 long sword (weapon in hand)\n  c: a +0 dagger (alternate weapon; not wielded)\n  d: an uncursed +3 small shield (being worn)\n  e: an uncursed food ration\n  f: an orcish dagger\n\n=== ADJACENT === N=. NE=. E=d(dog/canine)[PET — don't attack] SE=. S=. SW=. W=. NW=.\n\n=== HINT === No `>` visible. Nearest way out is an open doorway at (24,14) — `move_to(x=24, y=14)`. (3 exits visible.)\n\n=== VISIBLE FEATURES === door (open/gap) at (24,14), (29,14), (19,18); food/corpse at (32,17)\n\n=== VISIBLE MONSTERS === little dog at (23,17), 1 step E [PET - don't attack]\n"
          }
        ]
